   "phrasing": "greet_ans_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I want to record my songs at home. What's the bare minimum setup?",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 0.25,
   "block": "music.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A laptop, a decent microphone, headphones, and an audio interface to plug the mic into. That's honestly enough to start.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.64,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What kind of microphone?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.01,
   "block": "music.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "For singing at home, a simple condenser mic works well. It picks up detail, so record in a quiet room.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.5,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My room echoes",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "music.dlg20"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "like a bathroom.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 2.25,
   "block": "music.dlg20",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then hang blankets or duvets around you. Some people record in a wardrobe full of clothes, it sounds great.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "music.dlg20"
  },
  {
